  "summary": "CGI versions before 5.00 for Perl return request-derived values untainted under taint mode.",
  "details": "CGI versions before 5.00 for Perl return request-derived values untainted under taint mode.\n\nThe upload filename, uploadInfo values, some path_info and script_name values, Accept results, and the name lists from url_param and cookie are returned without the taint flag, as is a cookie named expires from 4.67 on.\n\nThese values come from regex captures or hash keys, which Perl does not taint, so they pass -T checks unvalidated.",
